  "notes": "{追|お}う is a godan verb meaning to chase, pursue, or follow.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pattern: ～⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{追|お}う\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{夢|ゆめ}→夢：01519_yume⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{追|お}う: to pursue a dream\n- ⟦{流行|りゅうこう}→流行：03678_ryuukou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{追|お}う: to follow trends\n- ⟦{犯人|はんにん}→犯人：03572_hannin⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{追|お}う: to chase a criminal\n- ⟦{時代|じだい}→時代：01424_jidai⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{追|お}う: to keep up with the times\n\nCOMPOUND VERBS:\n- ⟦{追|お}い{掛|か}ける→追い掛ける：04628_oikakeru⟧: to run after, to chase\n- ⟦{追|お}い{出|だ}す→追い出す：04625_oidasu⟧: to drive out, to expel\n- ⟦{追|お}い{越|こ}す→追い越す：04623_oikosu⟧: to overtake, to pass\n- ⟦{追|お}い{付|つ}く→追い付く：02015_oitsuku⟧: to catch up with\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{追|お}って⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ describes the ongoing state of chasing or pursuing something.",
